, c'est moins fatiguant que l'escalier. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le09ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "au bout de", "type": "name"}, {"content": "\u00e0 la fin de quelque chose", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(locution pr\u00e9positionnelle)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Allez au bout du couloir.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le09ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "pas mal", "type": "name"}, {"content": "plut\u00f4t bien", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(locution adjectivale)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Ces chaussures sont pas mal. Elles me plaisent beaucoup.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le09ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "frn2le09ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "D\u00e9signer quelque chose", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Pour d\u00e9signer quelque chose, on utilise un pronom d\u00e9monstratif compos\u00e9. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "La forme des pronoms d\u00e9monstratifs varie selon le genre et le nombre des \u00eatres ou des choses qu'ils repr\u00e9sentent. <br/> Le tableau suivant repr\u00e9sente l'ensemble des pronoms d\u00e9monstratifs compos\u00e9s : ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Singulier</span><br/>(masculin/f\u00e9minin)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Pluriel</span><br/>(masculin/f\u00e9minin)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"celui-ci/celle-ci <br/> celui-l\u00e0/celle-l\u00e0\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ceux-ci/celles-ci <br/> ceux-l\u00e0/celles-l\u00e0\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Les pronoms d\u00e9monstratifs compos\u00e9s remplacent un groupe nominal (nom + d\u00e9terminant). ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">celui-ci</span> d\u00e9signe la chose la plus proche de nous ; <span class=\"italic\">celui-l\u00e0</span> \u00e9voque quelque chose de plus \u00e9loign\u00e9. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "De toutes les chaussures, c'est celles-ci que je pr\u00e9f\u00e8re. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Quelles chaussures tu pr\u00e9f\u00e8res ? Celles-ci ou celles-l\u00e0 ? ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Parler d'un magasin", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Lorsque l'on veut pr\u00e9ciser ce en quoi le magasin est sp\u00e9cialis\u00e9, on utilise la pr\u00e9position <span class=\"strong\">de</span>. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Type de magasin</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Un magasin de chaussures\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Un magasin de v\u00eatements\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Un magasin d'\u00e9lectrom\u00e9nagers\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Un magasin de sport\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Choisissez deux magasins \u00e0 deux endroits ou \u00e9tages diff\u00e9rents. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "\u00c9crivez les indications pour se rendre \u00e0 ces magasins en partant de l'entr\u00e9e. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Utilisez des pr\u00e9positions. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "\u00c9crivez 20 \u00e0 30 mots. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Lisez vos indications \u00e0 un ami. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "Je peux dire o\u00f9 se situent les magasins dans un gratte-ciel. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "J'\u00e9cris un texte de 20 \u00e0 30 mots donnant des instructions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Je lis mes indications \u00e0 voix haute. ", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}